    "description": "STANDALONE LOCAL POSTMAN COLLECTION for Delivez Confidential Delivery (Delvez Vault).\n\nEverything is pre-configured directly inside this file:\n- Base URL: http://localhost:4000/api/v1\n- Pre-loaded Tokens: Both user and admin access tokens are pre-filled\n- Auto-Variables: Login and booking endpoints automatically save tokens and IDs to collection variables\n\nYou can import ONLY this file into Postman and execute requests immediately without needing an environment file.",
